# Pinned reference checkout for the ROS 2 real-data recording stack (RR_01).
#
# `iiwa_ros2` (ICube-Robotics) is used for two things only: `iiwa_description`
# (the driver-side URDF/xacro the FK-identity gate checks against) and the
# bundled `libFRI` 1.11 sources that `erd_iiwa` and `erd_fri_emulator` compile
# in place (CMake var `ERD_FRI_SDK_ROOT`). It is not vendored: `elastic_robot_sim`
# is public and `libFRI` carries KUKA's own SDK license (used-with-KUKA-products
# only), so it is referenced by path from the build workspace, never copied
# into this repository.
#
# Commit below is the laptop's local `jazzy-dev` working commit as of
# 2026-09-30 (RR_01 S1.1, I-10). If it is not reachable from a fresh clone
# (local-only commits on top of the branch), export it first:
#   git -C ~/projects/ros2_ws/src/iiwa_ros2 bundle create \
#       ~/projects/erd_ws/vendor/iiwa_ros2.bundle jazzy-dev
# and point this entry's `uri` at that bundle path instead.
repositories:
  iiwa_ros2:
    type: git
    url: https://github.com/ICube-Robotics/iiwa_ros2.git
    version: 600f0d9d22f80ae873b968e6dc7df57c4afb3712
